# Task lists, strikeout and autolinks

- [ ] unchecked
- [x] checked
- [X] checked with a capital
- plain item
- [ ] with a nested list
  - [x] deeper
- [ ] **bold** after the box

A tight list stays tight:

- [ ] one
- [ ] two

An ordered list has no task items, so the brackets stay literal:

1. [ ] not a task
2. [x] also not

Strikeout ~~across words~~, ~~*with emphasis*~~, and ~~nested ~~inner~~ text~~.
A lone tilde in the middle of a~word is literal, and so is ~~ ~~ with spaces.
Escaped delimiters stay text: \~\~not struck\~\~ and a \| pipe.

Autolinks: http://example.com/a?b=c&d=e and https://example.com and
www.example.com and ftp://files.example.com and user@example.com.
An autolink inside a list item:

- see https://example.com/x for more

